title: Prof
---
<<if isPeriod("Afternoon")>>
    Prof: Hey! You're the last student I'm talking to before leaving, what's up? 
    -> When's the next homework due? 
        <<jump annoyed>> 
    -> Do you have your chapel credits? 
        <<jump annoyed>>
    -> I don't understand the topics from last class. 
        <<jump leaves>>
    -> Uhhhhh I don't have any questions...
        <<jump annoyed>>
<<elseif getBool("scheduledMeeting")>>
    Prof: Alright, go sit down now.
    <<stop>>
<<else>>
    <<if getBool("lukeHasPaper") && !getBool("samBus") && !getBool("lucaSamBus")>>
        Player: I should get Luca to distract the teacher first.
        <<stop>>
    <<else>>
        <<if !getBool("teacherDistracted")>>
            Prof: Oh? Do you have a question?
            -> Can I talk to you during office hours? <<if hasActions()>>
                <<jump OfficeHours>>
            -> No, sorry.
                <<stop>>
        <<else>>
            Prof: Alright, go sit down now.
        <<endif>>
    <<endif>>
<<endif>>
===

title: OfficeHours
---
Prof: Yea sure, I'll write you in for my last scheduled time. They'll be in the classroom today after Lunch hour.
<<setBool "scheduledMeeting" true>>
<<useAction>>
<<if (getBool("samBus") || getBool("lucaSamBus"))>>
    <<setBool "posters" true>>
<<endif>>

<<stop>>
===

title: annoyed
---
Prof: You seriouslly scheduled a meeting just for that? 
<<gameOver "Don't ask the Prof a dump question.">>
<<stop>>
===

title: leaves
---
Prof: Ah ok, so looking at slidesho...
"LOUD WOLVERINE ROAR"
Prof: OH JEEZ, sorry I gotta GO! 
<<ProfLeaves>>
<<stop>>
===